			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T14:58:23.000Z",
			"content": "You were not alone. \nBrilliant.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
