			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716748,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/AdrienneTacke/status/1187073771686912000",
			"author": {
				"name": "Adrienne is home 🌵",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/AdrienneTacke",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/0a2894a507f79664a1d2717c225923e429b77d122ca0ea3e30ebf363e4bd17fe.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T18:30:16.000Z",
			"content": "This conference kickstarted my speaking journey. I'm forever grateful for <a href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\">@nejsconf</a>'s welcoming community and supportive organizers. Thank you ❤️\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/nejsconf/final/\"></a>",
			"type": "mention",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716749,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/ChrisFerdinandi/status/1187074035814821888",
			"author": {
				"name": "Chris Ferdinandi ⚓️",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/ChrisFerdinandi",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/c08ae1c4d75a3dae935062d5b6c914feff7cfbdafdb527c237ab3af3caa59ebc.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T18:31:19.000Z",
			"content": "I hope I can make it to NEJS at some point. I hear nothing but terrific things.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716771,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/asciidisco/status/1187079409808891904",
			"author": {
				"name": "Hagbard Celine",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/asciidisco",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/68753d18ca291eaf02474d8146a35fbca7795c40a94eb1c08f654706b6ef86ba.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T18:52:40.000Z",
			"content": "It was truly a pleasure to be part of it. Thank you &amp; all the other lovely folks who put their hearts &amp; lots of energy into making it.\nLots of ❤️ to all of you.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716767,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/scurker/status/1187081532428689409",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jason",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/scurker",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/ec73d50e96773712491ee468caed3c665675b91cc6d60e234df4b5a774dc3187.png"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T19:01:06.000Z",
			"content": "I’m bummed I missed out on the last conference. But I challenge you to find a nicer group of folks than those that put <a href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\">@nejsconf</a> together. Much ❤️ to the team for all of their hard work!\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/nejsconf/final/\"></a>",
			"type": "mention",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716834,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/davereid/status/1187083797608783873",
			"author": {
				"name": "💀 Dave (Reid) of the Dead 🎃",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/davereid",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/ad7ebdbeb69782362da07bb5708af497975b303db93ebf30b066c19df5fa5834.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T19:10:06.000Z",
			"content": "I feel extremely lucky and fortunate to have been able to attend four out of the five years. I'm so proud and thankful of all the very deliberate and hard work you and the rest of the organizers &amp; volunteers put in making an Omaha tech conf inclusive, safe, and enjoyable for all.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716858,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/TatianaTMac/status/1187098329605398529",
			"author": {
				"name": "Batty on a Mac 🦇💻 🔜 #a11yTO 🇨🇦",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/TatianaTMac",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/0a853c14606d8899da3c4fe339d86f7503b8d0ed667a95a384895b16ecca8ae8.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T20:07:51.000Z",
			"content": "When you have this talk was when I became a Zachstan. \n\nGiving the closing closing keynote to NEJSConf is one of my 2019 highlights. 🐟💙💛\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 716856,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1187103559705382912",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/17b0730965b5e7cdfabfca0c64d8f2d94cf4905b191b19bfcf59fa68f51d2d74.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-23T20:28:38.000Z",
			"content": "We were so glad to have you at the conference. TRY TO FIND A BETTER CLOSING KEYNOTE (you can’t)\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/TatianaTMac\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 717277,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/malchata/status/1187442372092653568",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jeremy @ PrDC Regina 🇨🇦",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/malchata",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/9a020d0fd8bdc0bca8f3135fcafbb9a3edfed1c1d234cb4418fb33543e298e4c.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-24T18:54:57.000Z",
			"content": "Not a dry eye in the house. This talk and the kindness you put on display tugged at my heartstrings.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 717275,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1187443512079536128",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/17b0730965b5e7cdfabfca0c64d8f2d94cf4905b191b19bfcf59fa68f51d2d74.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2019-10-24T18:59:29.000Z",
			"content": "Thank you for saying so Jeremy, it was really lovely to meet you. I will be sad not to have an avenue like this to meet excellent people without leaving town 😭\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/malchata\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nejsconf\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		}
